              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo baraá iigu'utuueene Yoshua kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú nguri ár, aa sihhiít geeraá malaykamoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Neetlaangw sleeme aa sihhiít bartá dakós oo doó /iyáy as nguwa sakwasleemuuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamooduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Neetlaangw guri báy, «Aá Neétlaangw, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kudá' gixsár Yerusalemu gaa tsawaar kuúng u iigahhaati. Asma heewí a adór hhartá tinda baraá asltá wa hhaákw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naxés Yoshua aa sihhiít dír geeraá malaykamo, tlabaá slasla/aren ngaa dahaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamo mukdá' geeraawós wa sihhimiít guri báy, «Tlabaawós kwisingá' slasla/aren duuxaak.» Aluuwo Yoshua guri báy, «Ga/aaweek, án tlakweemaawók iga hingeés, án kuúng u tsiitiís ar tlabaá ló'wa hhohho'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamoodá' iri oó', «Slamángw hhoohhoó' ti dahase'.» Inooín kuri slamángw hhoohhoó' i dahaás, kuri malé tlabií dahaás, malaykamoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa dír bihhaawós i sihhiít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo malaykamoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yoshua guri gurbuú' guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo i kaahi, ‹Kuúng barnaxés loohir'eé' aga eehát, nee hara'ayar'eé' bara ót, daqaní dooeé' u sawaawuti'iín nee un de'eén, aníng pa/aangw ngu haniís oo iwa i tseewuur tla/ángw kudá' geeraaeé' wa sihhimiita'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshúa, kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú, iia qaaseek, kuúng nee kaahamuuseedár hatlá' algadiyuusá', asma mukwí a layár ganaa', asma ga/aaweek, aníng sagadiyusmooeé' kudá' ta bay, Halmi ngu huúw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaa/anoowí naa qaás geeraá Yoshua ga/aawaak, inós gitsee/e ngi kon faanqw, aníng gooi an tleéhh gawaawósí ale, án tlakweemaá yaamuuká' in hingeés looár wák ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú heewo dirhunge inslaawmoowós gun iigu'uus iwa hardihi dír gamuú xa'anoowós oo sabiíbu nee oo /aantsihe as wayda kuwa saqwalaala/i nee amohhooa.› Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
